{"narration": "¿Sabes qué mira un mecánico en los primeros diez segundos que llegas al taller? No es el motor. Primero, la cadena: si cuelga mucho, ya te está robando fuerza. Segundo, las llantas: un borde gastado delata cómo frenas. Tercero, el humo del escape: si sale azul, está quemando aceite. Y lo último… cómo suena en mínimo. ¿Tu moto pasaría la prueba? Escríbenos y la revisamos.", "words": [["¿Sabes", 0.08, 0.425], ["qué", 0.425, 0.666], ["mira", 0.666, 0.959], ["un", 0.959, 1.147], ["mecánico", 1.147, 1.649], ["en", 1.649, 1.838], ["los", 1.838, 2.078], ["primeros", 2.078, 2.581], ["diez", 2.581, 2.874], ["segundos", 2.874, 3.376], ["que", 3.376, 3.616], ["llegas", 3.616, 4.014], ["al", 4.014, 4.202], ["taller?", 4.202, 4.6], ["No", 5.439, 5.828], ["es", 5.828, 6.217], ["el", 6.217, 6.606], ["motor.", 6.606, 7.319], ["Primero,", 8.268, 8.887], ["la", 9.046, 9.305], ["cadena:", 9.305, 9.852], ["si", 10.14, 10.399], ["cuelga", 10.399, 10.946], ["mucho,", 10.946, 11.422], ["ya", 11.58, 11.839], ["te", 11.839, 12.098], ["está", 12.098, 12.502], ["robando", 12.502, 13.121], ["fuerza.", 13.121, 13.668], ["Segundo,", 14.464, 15.08], ["las", 15.237, 15.567], ["llantas:", 15.567, 16.182], ["un", 16.469, 16.726], ["borde", 16.726, 17.199], ["gastado", 17.199, 17.815], ["delata", 17.815, 18.359], ["cómo", 18.359, 18.76], ["frenas.", 18.76, 19.304], ["Tercero,", 20.095, 20.586], ["el", 20.712, 20.918], ["humo", 20.918, 21.237], ["del", 21.237, 21.5], ["escape:", 21.5, 21.934], ["si", 22.163, 22.368], ["sale", 22.368, 22.688], ["azul,", 22.688, 23.008], ["está", 23.134, 23.454], ["quemando", 23.454, 24.002], ["aceite.", 24.002, 24.436], ["Y", 25.032, 25.185], ["lo", 25.185, 25.397], ["último…", 25.397, 25.843], ["cómo", 26.599, 27.375], ["suena", 27.375, 28.289], ["en", 28.289, 28.788], ["mínimo.", 28.788, 29.84], ["¿Tu", 30.497, 30.905], ["moto", 30.905, 31.538], ["pasaría", 31.538, 32.511], ["la", 32.511, 32.918], ["prueba?", 32.918, 33.778], ["Escríbenos", 34.793, 36.